{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026a2UXTjnlrX1795440289.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國饒舌歌手DON TOLIVER在英國一場演唱會，懷疑有人釋放催淚氣，逾1.2萬人要緊急疏散。</p><p></p><p>演唱會周日晚在曼徹斯特一座體育館舉行，當地緊急部門表示，在演唱會接近尾聲時，有人向群眾釋放疑似催淚氣，部分人出現眼部和呼吸道不適症狀，50多人接受醫生檢查，1人送院，警方正調查事件。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.975816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:12:11.594111+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:39.790395+00:00","content_hash":"150eccc0c2374a22275bdd0643f55cb7dc01a062325c791b030dd14ca481ccbf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.975816+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}